@startuml
title 通用任务执行器: 采集与执行解耦

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

package "业务侧(任意 goroutine)" as Biz {
  [Collect / Notify / TryCollect]
}

package "公共契约 basic" as Basic {
  interface "Executor[ITEM]" as Executor
  [Handler[ITEM]]
  [Status]
  [Stats]
  [Semaphore]
  [Errors]
}

package "执行引擎 basic/engine (内部)" as Engine {
  [有界采集队列\n(阻塞 | 丢弃)]
  [唯一 dispatcher goroutine]
  [批次缓冲区]
  [批次路由\nperiodic / size / arrival]
  [并发 worker 池\n(Semaphore 限流)]
  [指标与错误记录]
  [可重配置定时网格 delayQueue]
}

package "执行器实现" as Impl {
  [batch/periodic\nInterval | Compensate | Concurrent]
  [batch/threshold\n数量阈值 + 周期兜底]
  [triggered\n到达即执行]
}

Biz --> Executor : 只投递数据
Executor --> Engine : 统一实现
Impl ..|> Executor

Engine --> [Handler[ITEM]] : 批次回调(copy 语义: 切片复用)
Engine --> [Stats] : 只读快照
Engine --> [Status] : created/running/paused/closing/stopped

note right of [唯一 dispatcher goroutine]
  所有可变业务状态由 dispatcher 独占:
  - 采集热路径无需互斥锁
  - 批次划分、阈值判定、并发派发都在此串行决策
end note

note bottom of [并发 worker 池\n(Semaphore 限流)]
  并发上限可在运行期热更新:
  扩容/缩容都不会剥夺在途批次的额度
end note

@enduml
